{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep5/quest_story/15236290.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15236290","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15236290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1523629001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8C76C35CA3DD405D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","variant_male_record_index":"190685","variant_female_record_index":"190686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1523629001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你喜欢钓鱼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8C76C35CA3DD405D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、そなたは釣りが好きか？","variant_male_record_index":"190685","variant_female_record_index":"190686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1523629002:1":{"text":"それはすごいな！ならば気付いておるだろうが、あの洪水以来、ここらの魚の生態系が変わってきている。","source_cn":"这么厉害！那你有没有发现，洪水之后，水里的鱼，不再是我...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38CCF092F343F53E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それはすごいな！ならば気付いておるだろうが、あの洪水以来、ここらの魚の生態系が変わってきている。","female":"それはすごいな！ならば気付いておるだろうが、あの洪水以来、ここらの魚の生態系が変わってきている。","variant_male_record_index":"190687","variant_female_record_index":"190688","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523629004:1":{"text":"住民たちにとって魚は重要な食料源で、多くの人が釣りをして腹